#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapp-name; is a fun board game created after the famous oriental game of "
"Mahjong (from Chinese <foreignphrase lang=\"zh\">麻將</foreignphrase>). "
"Unlike the original however, &kapp-name; is a tile matching game for one or "
"two players."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kapp-name; the tiles are scrambled and staked on top of each other to "
"resemble a certain shape. The player then is expected to remove all the "
"tiles off the game board by locating each tile’s matching pair."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to play"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remove all the tiles off the game board by locating each tile’s matching "
"pair as fast as possible."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapp-name; will load a default layout automaticly one once you start the "
"game and you can start playing right away."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:77 index.docbook:81 index.docbook:188 index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "The game timer will not start until you make the first move."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should carefully study the stack of tiles lied out on the game board and "
"find two tiles matching exactly. When you have found such a pair use your "
"mouse to select these."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bear in mind that you can only select the tiles which have either of their "
"vertical sides open."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have selected the right pair of tiles they will vanish off the game "
"board, thus opening the tiles previously located underneath."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Find as many matches as possible to remove all the tiles from the game board."
msgstr ""

